# Large LEGS assets that are not stored in git. Fetch with scripts/download_assets.sh.
# Each file lands at its repo-relative <path>.
#
# Groups:
#   core     required by the simulator, the scene build and the renderers: the
#            Unitree G1 meshes, the object and table meshes with their collision
#            parts, and the flightroom splat. Downloaded as one archive,
#            LEGS-core-assets.tar.gz, from Google Drive
#   paper    wood-table splat + calibration (the background of the paper's
#            datasets) and the HDR-refit orange and plate meshes
#            (scripts/data/offline_renderer.py)
#   aug      appearance study: blue-table splat + calibration, apple and box meshes
#   sources  raw SAM 3D meshes (orange, plate, apple, box) before color refinement:
#            what the mesh-only baseline renders (offline_renderer_baseline.py),
#            and the orange and plate inputs of object_gen/color_refine_ccm.py
# The paper, aug and sources files are fetched one by one from the Hugging Face
# dataset hojjunekim/LEGS-assets.
#
# <group> <sha256> <bytes> <path>
